---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import Fixture from "../../components/Fixture.astro";
---
<Base title="Breadcrumb" description="iVOLT breadcrumb: an ordered list of links inside a labelled nav, with a CSS separator and aria-current on the last item. CSS only.">
  <article class="docs-prose">
    <h1>Breadcrumb</h1>
    <p>Shows where the current page sits in the site hierarchy. The separator is drawn with CSS so screen readers only read the links.</p>
    <p class="docs-meta"><strong>CSS:</strong> <code>css/components/breadcrumb.css</code> (in <code>ivolt.css</code>).</p>
    <Fixture name="breadcrumb/basic" />
    <h2>Markup</h2>
    <p><code>nav.iv-breadcrumb[aria-label="Breadcrumb"]</code> → <code>ol.iv-breadcrumb__list</code> → <code>li.iv-breadcrumb__item</code>. The last item carries <code>aria-current="page"</code> and is not a link.</p>
    <h2>Common mistakes</h2>
    <ul><li>Separator characters typed into the HTML (they get read aloud).</li><li>Linking the current page to itself.</li></ul>
  </article>
</Base>
